WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.700
[Upbeat instrumental music]

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.300
[Camera shutters click]

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:11.000
[The music builds; a whoosh as the phones scatter]

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.000
[A tap, then soft pops as guests join]

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.800
[The music builds]

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.300
[The music lifts; photos whoosh into the album]

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.400
[A success chime]

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.000
[A rising shimmer as the album fills]

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.000
[Soft pops as name tags appear]

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.000
[Bubbly pops and a message sound]

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.200
[A tap, then a confirmation ding]

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.000
[The music eases]

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.000
[The music ends]
